# RWTAS research-package prose and non-engine artifacts (not consumed by the
# engine; excluded from the public release). Parameter/provenance CSVs under
# configs/rwtas/packs/ are tracked; the items below are research prose,
# file-listing manifests, internal project-state copies, and raw third-party
# source downloads.
configs/rwtas/packs/**/*.md
configs/rwtas/packs/**/*.txt
configs/rwtas/packs/**/*.json
configs/rwtas/packs/**/MANIFEST.csv
configs/rwtas/packs/**/*_manifest.csv
configs/rwtas/packs/**/project_state*/
configs/rwtas/packs/**/project/
configs/rwtas/packs/**/sources/
configs/rwtas/packs/**/source_downloads/
